      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eomonoto oo nkitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin nemeishu te Yerusalem",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le ile, to lapa le ile, te nkolong e miet o lapa, ore atonita te nkaji ai, tenebo ilpayiani le Yuda etoni te dukuya nanu, ore enkaina o Laitoriani Enkai naaiteleikino nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.1.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 1.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ina peyie adol naa ng'ura, enkitanyaanyukoto natiu anaa eno ltung'ani; ore tiabori enye ine netiu anaa empolos enye naa enkima, ore te shumata empolos enye netiu anaa enkitanyaanyukoto naitiil oleng, anaa osuyai oitiil otisikaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitorioo enkitanyaanyukoto neeijo enkaina, naaya nanu adumu aibung ilpapit le ndukuya ai; naadumu nanu Enkiyang'et ailepie aya erishata e nkop o keper, naayau nanu too nduaat Enkai Yerusalem, naapik kishomi najing'ieki endung'oroto e atua ina naipirare moikuape, ine apa netii olorika le nkitanyaanyukoto o lom, ina naipiru aaku olom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.1.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 1.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa ng'ura, etii enkitoo e Nkai e Israel ine anaa apa enduaata natoduaa te nkisiajata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, taraposhu nkonyek inono shumata ing'ura enkalo e moikuape.” Metaa ataraposhuo nkonyek aainei aitorioki moikuape, naa ng'ura, ore te moikuape e kishomi olperere lo lasar, teine nejing'ieki, netii apa enkitanyaanyukoto olom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, idolita enaasita ninche, olminong kitok oasita enkaji e Israel tene, aaraa nanu aitalam ewueji ai sinyati? Kake eton ake intoki adol likae minong sapuk.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naayau nanu kutuk aji e ilo odung'oro; ore peyie aing'or, ng'ura etii enaudoto natii esuntai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, tuturo atua esuntai”, ore peyie atur esuntai, ng'ura netii kutuk aji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki ninye nanu, “Shomo atua, nidol intabo olminong naasita ninche tene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa nalo atua nadol; ore teine, etisiraki te suntai aaitaman ing'uesi pooki naaiserpepiari, o ng'uesi pooki torrok o nkitanyaanyukot oo nkaitin pooki nemeishu enkaji e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe te dukuya ninche iltung'ana ntomoni naapishana loo lpayiani le nkaji e Israel, tenebo Yaasania olayioni le Shafan eitashe tenebo ninche. Neeta ake pooki ng'ae lenye entoki napejieki enkorropil te nkaina enye, neilep empuruo enkorropil shumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee aajoki ninye nanu, “Enkerai e tung'ani, itodua enaasita ilpayiani le nkaji e Israel tenaimin, pooki tung'ani ake tiatua olgilata lenye too mpishai? Amu ejo ninche, ‘Medol iyiook Olaitoriani, eibayie Olaitoriani enkop.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naaitoki ake ajoki nanu, “Intoki ake adol kulie tabo olminong naasita ninche.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie aariku nanu kishomi enkalo e moikuape enkaji o Laitoriani; naa ng'ura, etoni inkituaak teine naaishiraki enkai enye naji Tammus",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tammus",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "enkai apa nadamuni aajo enoonkaitubulu naa ore pee eye inkaitubulu neji etua neji nepok te likae ari",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee aajoki ninye nanu, “Itodua iyie ena, iyie nakerai e tung'ani? Intoki ake adol intabo olminong sapuki naalang kuna.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naayau ninye nanu olgilata liatua le nkaji o Laitoriani: naa ng'ura ore te kutukaji e nkaji o Laitoriani, enerish eneimi olgoriet o lperere, netii iltung'ana oobaya tikitam o imiet, eisho nkoriong'i enye ina aji Olaitoriani, neing'orita nkomomi enye enkalo o loosaen, eomon enkolong te nkalo oloosaen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina pee aajoki ninye nanu, “Itoduaa iyie ena, Nakerai e tung'ani? Kentoki nalelek te nkaji e Yuda pee eas intabo olminong naasita tene, eji metaa keiput enkop pooki enkikonya naainuaaki nanu oleng matagoroyu? Ng'ura, epik olng'osila lenye inkumeishin enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa kaitame te ngoro napi; meitoki enkong'u ai aleku, nemaitoki aata nanu olng'ur; ore hoo neishir too nkiyiaa aainei to ltoilo sapuk, mainining'u ninche.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
